1722.1-2021 §7.2.13, pp. 81–82, Table 7-23, defines number_of_clusters at offset 12: “The number of clusters within the Port.” Dynamic mapping uses number_of_maps=0; it does not waive Milan's cluster minimum.\n\nThe zero-cluster 8x8 input pools recorded by parent D8 (docs/ENDSTATION_BUILDER.md) and docs/reference/PP_DESCRIPTOR_OWNERSHIP.md therefore conflict with Milan §5.3.3.8. Their correction is a parent decision. Successful packing is no waiver. No F07.2 multiplicity edit will be made in this lane; #125's separate documentation work continues.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/5853884588/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]